The MIT text below is reproduced so that release archives carry a notice for
this dependency, which is linked into GoshCoder's Windows builds through
Bubble Tea. The copyright line follows the form the same author uses in his
modules that do ship one (github.com/mattn/go-isatty).

If upstream adds a LICENSE file, delete this exception: the collector prefers
the module's own text and only falls back here when there is none.

